{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010800/extras/e98618cdcbeb1ea58e69ec16bcafe373.poster.avif?t=1760519903\" width=616 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010800/extras/e98618cdcbeb1ea58e69ec16bcafe373.webm?t=1760519903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010800/extras/e98618cdcbeb1ea58e69ec16bcafe373.mp4?t=1760519903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The demo includes one mission and three jobs. Players will become familiar with the mechanics of three vehicles: the Ship-to-Shore crane, Reach Stacker and Straddle Carrier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010800/extras/9dc6ff80b97fd64ff334fad4607a9059.poster.avif?t=1760519903\" width=616 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010800/extras/9dc6ff80b97fd64ff334fad4607a9059.webm?t=1760519903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010800/extras/9dc6ff80b97fd64ff334fad4607a9059.mp4?t=1760519903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Vehicle precision and management skills are vital to your rebuilding and expansion efforts. Sign new contracts to build up your resources, then make high-priority cargo runs to fulfill your commitments. When the wear and tear starts to drag your equipment down, execute repairs under strict deadlines to continue your work. In Docked, every task is a critical piece of the puzzle in your day-to-day life from one end of the dock to another.  <br>    <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010800/extras/f63c1e6d34d401aed3f750b090d5eeb0.poster.avif?t=1760519903\" width=616 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010800/extras/f63c1e6d34d401aed3f750b090d5eeb0.webm?t=1760519903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010800/extras/f63c1e6d34d401aed3f750b090d5eeb0.mp4?t=1760519903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">From colossal ship-to-shore cranes to sturdy, heavy-duty tractors, take control of a fleet of powerful machinery engineered specifically to fulfill your contracts and sometimes, save lives. Carefully tighten ropes to reposition raw materials and optimize weight distribution on flatbed trucks. Intricately navigate delicate cargo through tight spaces with little margin for error. Created with realistic size, scale and precise handling at the forefront, gain a first-hand understanding of what it means to work a dock. <br>    <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010800/extras/9a0ef983c78c1c2baf27508e0aaf47c1.poster.avif?t=1760519903\" width=616 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010800/extras/9a0ef983c78c1c2baf27508e0aaf47c1.webm?t=1760519903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010800/extras/9a0ef983c78c1c2baf27508e0aaf47c1.mp4?t=1760519903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">To save the family business, you must sign contracts to create and foster new logistical chains, ensuring the profitability of your wharf. Every job you take earns the cash necessary to invest in your operation and acquire new, powerful machinery. Purchase new lots to store your vehicles, upgrade your fueling capacity and power supply, and conquer new business milestones. Rebuild Port Wake, one cargo lift at a time.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4010800?t=1760519903","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4010800?t=1760519903","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010800/cc5124e4cd3331e9fa935c58d237f206db4c05ec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760519903","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010800/cc5124e4cd3331e9fa935c58d237f206db4c05ec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760519903","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010800/extras/e98618cdcbeb1ea58e69ec16bcafe373.poster.avif?t=1760519903\" width=616 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010800/extras/e98618cdcbeb1ea58e69ec16bcafe373.webm?t=1760519903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010800/extras/e98618cdcbeb1ea58e69ec16bcafe373.mp4?t=1760519903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The demo includes one mission and three jobs. Players will become familiar with the mechanics of three vehicles: the Ship-to-Shore crane, Reach Stacker and Straddle Carrier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010800/extras/9dc6ff80b97fd64ff334fad4607a9059.poster.avif?t=1760519903\" width=616 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010800/extras/9dc6ff80b97fd64ff334fad4607a9059.webm?t=1760519903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010800/extras/9dc6ff80b97fd64ff334fad4607a9059.mp4?t=1760519903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Vehicle precision and management skills are vital to your rebuilding and expansion efforts. Sign new contracts to build up your resources, then make high-priority cargo runs to fulfill your commitments. When the wear and tear starts to drag your equipment down, execute repairs under strict deadlines to continue your work. In Docked, every task is a critical piece of the puzzle in your day-to-day life from one end of the dock to another.  <br>    <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010800/extras/f63c1e6d34d401aed3f750b090d5eeb0.poster.avif?t=1760519903\" width=616 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010800/extras/f63c1e6d34d401aed3f750b090d5eeb0.webm?t=1760519903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010800/extras/f63c1e6d34d401aed3f750b090d5eeb0.mp4?t=1760519903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">From colossal ship-to-shore cranes to sturdy, heavy-duty tractors, take control of a fleet of powerful machinery engineered specifically to fulfill your contracts and sometimes, save lives. Carefully tighten ropes to reposition raw materials and optimize weight distribution on flatbed trucks. Intricately navigate delicate cargo through tight spaces with little margin for error. Created with realistic size, scale and precise handling at the forefront, gain a first-hand understanding of what it means to work a dock. <br>    <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010800/extras/9a0ef983c78c1c2baf27508e0aaf47c1.poster.avif?t=1760519903\" width=616 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010800/extras/9a0ef983c78c1c2baf27508e0aaf47c1.webm?t=1760519903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010800/extras/9a0ef983c78c1c2baf27508e0aaf47c1.mp4?t=1760519903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">To save the family business, you must sign contracts to create and foster new logistical chains, ensuring the profitability of your wharf. Every job you take earns the cash necessary to invest in your operation and acquire new, powerful machinery. Purchase new lots to store your vehicles, upgrade your fueling capacity and power supply, and conquer new business milestones. Rebuild Port Wake, one cargo lift at a time.</p>","developers":["Saber Interactive"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2487300","name":"Docked"},"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010800/4383398e00a361c197e0aecd09e3cfacead4